    For questions and ideas:

    p/\R/\LySiS:  Node 1-3 : +49 (0)30 721 60 71 - USR DUAL V.FAST 28800
                  Node 4   : +49 (0)30 722 60 65 - USR DUAL V.FAST 28800


    Did you ever get nerves, that it`s only possible to get somebody in 
    the chat by the console ? Don`t worry...Now you have NCHAT !!!


    NCHAT is a tool, which allows (Co-) Sysops to chat from one node to 
    another. "YES" that`s right !!! NCHAT emulates the possibility to 
    start a Sysop-Chat from another node, as like as the Sysop is sitting
    in front of the console and pushes F1. That it works, you need several
    nodes. :)


    NCHAT gives you the possibility to start NCHAT whenever you want 
    (as long as a user is online). You can also drop a user out the bbs,
    as like as the (Co-) Sysop is sitting in front the console. The user,
    that you want to chat with, must call via modem. It`s not possible to
    use NCHAT with local nodes. That`s not useful, because in this case you 
    you have still the "operator page". :)
    I`m still working on the "Account-Editing", that`s why this is "only"
    a ß-version.


    NCHAT is easy to install. Just put the 3 files "NodeSysopChat",
    "NodeSysopChat.start.txt" and "NodeSysopChat.end.txt" in a directory.
    Install "NodeSysopChat" as a XIM-Door, and change the 2 text files
    "NodeSysopChat.start.txt" and "NodeSysopChat.end.txt" like you want
    and now start it. :)


    "NodeSysopChat.start.txt" is shown at the beginning from NCHAT,
    "NodeSysopChat.end.txt" at the end from NCHAT, also like startchat.txt
    and endchat.txt at the normal sysopchat. Both text-files must stand
    in the same directory then the door. In the file "NodeSysopChat.start.txt"
    you can see with the symbol "§" at the beginning of the chat the name of
    the (Co-) Sysop, which just used NCHAT.


    If you are in the chat, you have 2 commands. With CTRL-C you can end the
    chat. CTRL-F shows you more functions.

    
    1. D - With "D" you can drop a user on another node

    2. E - That is going to be the account-editing

    3. S - Gives you the possibility to do something in the bbs between
           you are still in the chat. During this time the use is on ice.

    4. Q - With "Q" you can quit the menue


    Other functions will follow in the other versions, because I have to do 
    something in the future.


    So, I think that`s all what you have to know about NCHAT....
    Have fun and in case if you find mistakes or if you have new ideas,
    please call my bbs.



